        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8050EN, Elan Lever with Regular Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Elan Swirl Lever with Round Rose is stunning in its quiet elegance. It is a beautiful, traditional lever that features a classic swirl design that is best displayed with finishes that have natural highlights, such as oil rubbed bronze. The Elan Lever with Regular Round Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This interior door lever will fit 1-1/4 inch to  inch thick doors and is available in either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Elan Leverset with Regular Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Elan Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n Levers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-7-finish.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
