                "title": "Elan Swirl Lever with Round Rose",
                "description": "The Elan Swirl Lever with Round Rose is stunning in its quiet elegance. It is a beautiful, traditional lever that features a classic swirl design that is best displayed with finishes that have natural highlights, such as oil rubbed bronze. The Elan Lever with Regular Round Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This interior door lever will fit 1-1/4 inch to  inch thick doors and is available in either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
